VALUES ('Dalip Tahil', 'Dalip Tahil', 'dalip-tahil', 'Male', 'Acting', '1952-10-30', 'Agra, Uttar Pradesh, India', 'Dalip Tahil (born 30 October 1952) is a veteran Indian actor in film, television, and theatre. With a distinguished career spanning five decades and over 100 films, Tahil is celebrated for iconic roles in historic blockbusters such as Baazigar (1993), Qayamat Se Qayamat Tak (1988), Darr (1993), Kaho Naa... Pyaar Hai (2000), Bhaag Milkha Bhaag (2013), and Mission Mangal (2019). He has also appeared in international productions including Richard Attenborough\'s Oscar-winning Gandhi (1982) and the BBC soap opera EastEnders.', 'people/photos/dalip-tahil.jpg', 'https://www.instagram.com/daliptahil', '{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/daliptahil\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0846665\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
