VALUES ('Janel Parrish', 'Janel Parrish', 'janel-parrish', 'Female', 'Acting', '1988-10-30', 'Honolulu, Hawaii, USA', 'Janel Meilani Parrish Long (born October 30, 1988) is an American actress and singer. She is best known for starring as Mona Vanderwaal in the smash-hit mystery teen drama series Pretty Little Liars (2010–2017) and its spinoff The Perfectionists (2019), winning four Teen Choice Awards for Choice TV Villain. She also starred as Margot Covey in Netflix\'s beloved To All the Boys film series (2018–2021) and competed on Season 19 of Dancing with the Stars, placing third.', 'people/photos/janel-parrish.jpg', 'https://www.instagram.com/janelparrish', '{\"instagram\":\"https:\\/\\/www.instagram.com\\/janelparrish\",\"twitter\":\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/janelparrish\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0663544\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
