VALUES ('Kevin Pollak', 'Kevin Pollak', 'kevin-pollak', 'Male', 'Acting', '1957-10-30', 'San Francisco, California, USA', 'Kevin Pollak (born October 30, 1957) is an acclaimed American actor, comedian, impressionist, and podcast pioneer. He is widely recognized for his standout roles in classic films such as The Usual Suspects (Todd Hockney), A Few Good Men (Lt. Sam Weinberg), Casino, Grumpy Old Men, and The Whole Nine Yards. On television, he portrayed Moishe Maisel in the multi-Emmy-winning Amazon series The Marvelous Mrs. Maisel (2017–2023), for which he shared two Screen Actors Guild Awards.', 'people/photos/kevin-pollak.jpg', 'https://twitter.com/kevinpollak', '{\"twitter\":\"https:\\/\\/twitter.com\\/kevinpollak\",\"imdb\":\"https:\\/\\/www.imdb.com\\/name\\/nm0001629\\/\"}', 1, 'active', 1, @now, @now)
